  "content": "<img src=\"https://github.com/Polyfrost/PolyCrosshair/raw/main/src/main/resources/polycrosshair.svg\" alt=\"PolyCrosshair 圖示\"><h1>PolyCrosshair</h1><p><img src=\"https://polyfrost.org/img/compact_vector.svg\" alt=\"Compact Powered by OneConfig\">  <img src=\"https://img.shields.io/github/v/release/Polyfrost/PolyCrosshair.svg?style=for-the-badge&amp;color=1452cc&amp;label=release\" alt=\"開發工作流程狀態\"></p><p>一個準星修改模組</p><h2>功能特色</h2><ul>\n<li>彩色畫布</li>\n<li>顏色反轉</li>\n<li>動態色彩</li>\n<li>旋轉效果</li>\n<li>設定檔系統</li>\n<li>匯入 / 匯出</li>\n</ul><h2>展示圖庫</h2><p><img src=\"https://github.com/Polyfrost/PolyCrosshair/raw/main/images/settings-page.png\" alt=\"設定頁面.png\"></p>",
